# TEMPLATE: a wish that changes the knight's shots (bigger, burning, frozen,
# poisoned, shoving, bouncing, splitting...).
# Copy this file, then change what it says. Check it with
#   cargo run -p angel-delve --example content_check -- <your file>
#
# Change: the id, the Name, the `say` lines, the effect word that IS the thing
#   asked for (bigger: size; fire: burn; ice: chill; poison; push: knock;
#   returning: boomerang; faster shots: velocity; more: shots; through: pierce),
#   the scroll lines, the shot picture (facing right, at most 16x16, drawn pixel
#   for pixel at a shot's size), the card art.
# Keep: five tiers that each give more; `damage` only as a small extra on the
#   last tiers, never as the wish itself; the look as a `draw shot`.
# Effects: a recipe (see effect-shot.vfx) goes on every tier as `vfx` card
#   lines, `;` between, so each tier's card plays it; without one the game
#   gives it a look from its words.
# The bar: pictures Fine or better (a template, Masterwork); each `say` finds
#   this wish and no other.
wish bigger-arrows | Bigger Arrows
say bigger arrows | big arrows | huge arrows | giant arrows | larger arrows | fat arrows
tier size 1 :: Your arrows are bigger, and strike wider.
tier size 2 :: Bigger again, and wider still.
tier size 2; knock 1 :: Huge arrows that shove what they hit.
tier size 2; knock 2 :: Huge arrows that throw back what they hit.
tier size 2; knock 2; damage 8 :: Giant arrows: they throw back what they hit, and hit harder.
draw shot
.2.......jW.
22ooooooojWW
.2.......jW.

art
